{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete:\n\nD-cysteine catabolic process | GO:0019447\nD-leucine catabolic process | GO:1900832\nD-lysine catabolic process | GO:0019476\nD-tyrosine catabolic process | GO:1900829\nD-valine catabolic process | GO:1902079\nD-valine metabolic process | GO:1902114\nD-serine metabolic process | GO:0070178\nD-alanine metabolic process | GO:0046436\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31357\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16bBEAEgV0ekXO4MDwMDL0tUjtOSAJ41BOP46cecH5zo/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nEcoCyc 1\nEcoliWiki 1\nFlyBase 1\nGeneDB 1\nSGD 3 - done\n~TAIR 1~\nUniProt 6\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n \n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-01-26T19:39:23Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to D-amino acid catabolic and metabolic process terms", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-02-12T09:23:47Z"}
